  <data name="HowToPlayText" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Minesweeper is a simple yet engaging game.
It relies entirely on logic and a little bit of luck.

Your goal is to uncover the entire 
field by marking mine locations with 
flags 🚩.

Left Mouse Button (LMB) — Open a cell.
Right Mouse Button (RMB) — Place or remove a flag.

If you hit a mine, the game is over. The numbers indicate how many 
mines are hidden in the adjacent 
cells. Stay sharp, think ahead, and try 
to clear the field without any 
mistakes. 

Good luck, </value>
